<title>AUSTRALIA: Gandel reports higher year net profit.</title>
<headline>Gandel reports higher year net profit.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   53.56  vs  51.66</p>
<p>    Net				    53.56  vs  51.66</p>
<p>    Final distribution (cents)	4.02  vs   3.93</p>
<p>    Total distribution (cents)	7.90  vs   7.80</p>
<p>    Sales				  76.68  vs  65.46</p>
<p>    Other income			  2.81  vs   2.05</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   7.42  vs   7.31</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			nil   vs   nil</p>
<p>Final distribution is 18.87 percent tax deferred  </p>
<p>Pay date Aug 25</p>
<p>Reg date Jun 30</p>
<p>    Tax				     nil   vs   nil</p>
<p>    Interest				9.38  vs   2.20</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  0.05  vs   nil</p>
<p>    Minorities			    nil   vs   nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Gandel Retail Trust is a shopping centre owner.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
